### GrowWise sample API requests (VS Code "REST Client" or JetBrains HTTP Client).
### Cookies are kept per file by the client. Every state-changing request needs X-Requested-With (CSRF defence).
@host = http://localhost:5000/api
@json = application/json

### 1. Register a parent (role is always "parent"; sending a role is rejected)
POST {{host}}/auth/register
Content-Type: {{json}}
X-Requested-With: XMLHttpRequest

{ "name": "Asha Rao", "email": "asha@example.com", "password": "Passw0rd-demo" }

### 2. Log in (sets the httpOnly cookie gw_token)
POST {{host}}/auth/login
Content-Type: {{json}}
X-Requested-With: XMLHttpRequest

{ "email": "asha@example.com", "password": "Passw0rd-demo" }

### 3. Who am I?
GET {{host}}/auth/me

### 4. Create a child profile
POST {{host}}/children
Content-Type: {{json}}
X-Requested-With: XMLHttpRequest

{ "displayName": "Mia", "ageGroup": "6-8", "interests": ["art", "nature"], "goals": ["move-more"] }

### 5. List children (copy an _id into @childId)
GET {{host}}/children

@childId = PASTE_CHILD_ID
@activityId = PASTE_ACTIVITY_ID

### 6. Browse activities with filters + pagination
GET {{host}}/activities?category=creativity&age=7&maxDuration=30&q=stone&page=1&limit=10

### 7. Assign a task
POST {{host}}/tasks
Content-Type: {{json}}
X-Requested-With: XMLHttpRequest

{ "childId": "{{childId}}", "activityId": "{{activityId}}", "scheduledDate": "2026-10-15T12:00:00.000Z", "dueDate": "2026-10-16T12:00:00.000Z", "parentNote": "After snack" }

@taskId = PASTE_TASK_ID

### 8. Open child mode (replaces the cookie with a child-locked session)
POST {{host}}/children/{{childId}}/session
Content-Type: {{json}}
X-Requested-With: XMLHttpRequest

{}

### 9. (child mode) Submit the task
POST {{host}}/tasks/{{taskId}}/submit
Content-Type: {{json}}
X-Requested-With: XMLHttpRequest

{ "childNote": "I painted a fox", "minutesSpent": 25 }

### 10. (child mode) Verification is forbidden -> 403
POST {{host}}/tasks/{{taskId}}/verify
Content-Type: {{json}}
X-Requested-With: XMLHttpRequest

{ "decision": "approve" }

### 11. Leave child mode with the parent password
POST {{host}}/auth/exit-child-mode
Content-Type: {{json}}
X-Requested-With: XMLHttpRequest

{ "password": "Passw0rd-demo" }

### 12. (parent) Approve — points come from the Activity record; sending points is rejected (422)
POST {{host}}/tasks/{{taskId}}/verify
Content-Type: {{json}}
X-Requested-With: XMLHttpRequest

{ "decision": "approve", "parentNote": "Great job" }

### 13. Log movement (manual)
POST {{host}}/physical-activity
Content-Type: {{json}}
X-Requested-With: XMLHttpRequest

{ "childId": "{{childId}}", "activityType": "walking", "durationMinutes": 30, "activityDate": "2026-10-14T12:00:00.000Z", "note": "Park" }

### 14. Games: questions, then submit answers (server scores them)
GET {{host}}/games
###
GET {{host}}/games/pattern-quiz/questions?childId={{childId}}&count=5
###
POST {{host}}/games/pattern-quiz/attempts
Content-Type: {{json}}
X-Requested-With: XMLHttpRequest

{ "childId": "{{childId}}", "durationSeconds": 60, "hintsUsed": 0, "answers": [ { "questionId": "p68-1", "answer": "10" } ] }

### 15. Safety lessons
GET {{host}}/safety-lessons?childId={{childId}}

### 16. Progress, weekly report, recommendations, badges
GET {{host}}/children/{{childId}}/progress?range=week
###
GET {{host}}/children/{{childId}}/reports/weekly
###
GET {{host}}/children/{{childId}}/recommendations?minutes=20&limit=5
###
GET {{host}}/children/{{childId}}/badges
